We entered the restaurant around the time most families\nfinished their dinner, which meant finding a vacant table\nwas pretty easy.%K%P
我们进入这家饭店的时间，\n已经晚到差不多该是一家人吃完饭准备回去了的时间，\n所以空着的坐席看起来非常多。%K%P
