Ms. Amagi, apparently understanding my situation, looked\naround the bright but rather boring interior.%K%P
在我面前的天城小姐带着一副悠然自得的样子，\n向明亮却没有半点热闹气氛的店内张望着。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dCould it be that you dislike things like pasta and pizza?\nIn that case, I'm sorry for forcing this restaurant on\nyou.\d%K%P
